record templartorrent.evidence.port-mapping/1 : evidence {
    title "17 portmap tests. NAT-PMP over loopback: success with deletes on stop, result code 2, ignored replies from a spoofed IP and from the wrong port, timeout after 3 tries, renewal at half a 2 s lifetime, Driver shutdown removing the mapping. UPnP: a miniupnpd-shaped WANIPConnection with deletes, WANPPPConnection only, error 725 falling back to lease 0, a LOCATION on 127.0.0.2 refused and never contacted, a description over 64 KiB refused. Persist, worker and UI tests: the setting defaults off, round-trips and is reapplied on relaunch. portmap_parsers fuzz: 773832 runs in 61 s, regression replayed, no crash. Read-only probe of the real hotel gateway 10.10.10.1: no NAT-PMP reply in 3.75 s, no SSDP answer in 3 s, no mapping requested. Not yet tested against a router that answers."
